{"id":"n15045-1-6","stage":3,"title":"들어주다 · 听取","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15045-1-6-1","ko":"부탁이 하나 있는데, 들어줄 수 있어요?","zh":"有个请求想麻烦你，能帮帮我吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부탁이","meaning":"拜托，请求，托付","explanation":"부탁：拜托，请求，托付；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부탁","audio":"/audio/941d76ddd357e6c67c2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59301","senseId":"1","lemma":"부탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나","meaning":"某种","explanation":"하나：某种","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"5","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데,","meaning":"有、存在","explanation":"있다：有、存在；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어줄","meaning":"听取，同意，答应","explanation":"들어주다：听取，同意，答应；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들어주다","audio":"/audio/aefbe5b7ff70b65e0dd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15045","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"941d76ddd357e6c6","term":"부탁","zh":"拜托，请求，托付","audio":"/audio/941d76ddd357e6c67c2e.mp3","entryId":"59301","definition":"请他人做某事或将某事委托给他人。","pronunciation":["부ː탁"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"某种","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"不明确表明某个物体，只表示某种种类。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有、存在；能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"有、存在","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"aefbe5b7ff70b65e","term":"들어주다","zh":"听取，同意，答应","audio":"/audio/aefbe5b7ff70b65e0dd2.mp3","entryId":"15045","definition":"接受他人的拜托或要求等。","pronunciation":["드러주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]}],"audio":"/audio/aad80e53069ede1df3c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15045-1-6-2","ko":"뭔데요? 들어줄 수 있는 거면 들어줄게요.","zh":"什么请求啊？如果可以的话我当然会帮的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭔데요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어줄","meaning":"听取，同意，答应","explanation":"들어주다：听取，同意，答应；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들어주다","audio":"/audio/aefbe5b7ff70b65e0dd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15045","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거면","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어줄게요.","meaning":"听取，同意，答应","explanation":"들어주다：听取，同意，答应；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"들어주다","audio":"/audio/aefbe5b7ff70b65e0dd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15045","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"aefbe5b7ff70b65e","term":"들어주다","zh":"听取，同意，答应","audio":"/audio/aefbe5b7ff70b65e0dd2.mp3","entryId":"15045","definition":"接受他人的拜托或要求等。","pronunciation":["드러주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff92b2d97c75c883f36b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15045","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有个请求想麻烦你，能帮帮我吗？","什么请求啊？如果可以的话我当然会帮的。","我打算办健康保险，不知道选哪家比较好？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["有个请求想麻烦你，能帮帮我吗？","什么请求啊？如果可以的话我当然会帮的。","我打算办健康保险，不知道选哪家比较好？"],"answer":1}]}
